nh th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft). D\u7921\'3fa tr\'ean bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra, khi c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi ra l\u7879\'3fnh thu, l\u7879\'3fnh ph\u7841\'3f}{\f113\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1587834\charrsid12479943 t \'f0}{
